<aside class="blueprint secondscrn-study" aria-labelledby="secondscrn-title" data-stage="display">
  <div class="release-label">SecondScrn / v0.0.1</div>
  <h2 id="secondscrn-title" class="blueprint-title">My tablet is a Windows monitor now.</h2>
  <p class="blueprint-intro">SecondScrn puts an extra Windows desktop on my Android tablet. Touch and pen input go back to the PC.</p>
